sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant V as attached vital code
    Note over P,UI: Only while the CTC Office has a switch command in effect (maintenance, UC-11).
    P->>UI: click Set switch manually
    UI->>S: switches
    S-->>UI: each switch, its position and the CTC command
    P->>UI: choose a switch, Normal or Reverse
    UI->>S: setSwitch(id, reverse)
    alt not in maintenance
        S-->>UI: refused: only while the CTC has maintenance on
    else maintenance
        S->>W: manual_switches[id] := reverse
        S->>W: scan()
        W->>V: HAND_s, HANDREV_s, CTCCMD_s
        V-->>W: OUT_SW_s: CTC command, else hand-set, else program
        S-->>UI: terminal (the CTC's command wins if it has one)
        UI-->>P: switch shown as hand-set
    end
    opt release
        P->>UI: Release
        UI->>S: releaseSwitch(id)
        S->>W: drop the hand-set position, scan()
    end
    Note right of W: Sent to the Track Model on the next scan (UC-13). Ending maintenance releases it.
